.vercel

# Leftover logo experiments from earlier iterations, kept on disk but never shipped.
# provex.webp used to belong here, back when the sidebar linked out to ProveX and
# pulled its logo from an external URL. It is now the PRVX token's own logo, served
# from our own root -- so it has to be committed like any other asset. It was not,
# and the file sat on this machine only: local builds looked right and production
# rendered a coin with no logo. Anything under public/ that live code references
# must be tracked, or it simply does not exist on the deployed site.
public/l.png
public/liberty.jpg
public/logo.svg
public/p.png
public/prove.jpg
